  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Comprehensive Program to Address Urban Poverty</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Programa Integral de Atencin a la Pobreza Urbana</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Apoyar los esfuerzos del GOM para superar la pobreza urbana y mejorar la calidad de vida de los hogares en situacin de pobreza patrimonial, mediante el acceso adecuado a servicios sociales y de infraestructura bsica de la poblacin residente en zonas deficitarias del sistema urbano nacional.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support the efforts of the GOM to alleviate urban poverty and improve the quality of life of households that live below the &quot;pobreza patrimonial&quot; line. It will do so by means of providing access to basic social and infrastructure services in geographical areas that have been identified to have large service deficits.</narrative>
  </description>
